glish (exam term)", "العربية", "Français"], ["what-if question", "سؤال الاحتمالات", "question de simulation"], ["campaign cost", "تكلفة الحملة", "coût de campagne"], ["cost split", "فصل التكاليف", "ventilation des coûts"], ["illustrative", "توضيحي", "indicatif"]], [["Item", "Answer"], ["Contribution margin per unit", "14.00: 40.00 − 26.00 = 14.00."], ["Operating income at 300,000 units", "1,200,000: 300,000 × 14.00 = 4,200,000, and 4,200,000 − 3,000,000 = 1,200,000."], ["Operating income at 350,000 units", "1,900,000: 350,000 × 14.00 = 4,900,000, and 4,900,000 − 3,000,000 = 1,900,000."], ["Breakeven in units", "214,286: 3,000,000 ÷ 14.00 = 214,286."], ["Units for a 1,500,000 net income target", "357,143: the pre-tax target is 1,500,000 ÷ 0.75 = 2,000,000, so 3,000,000 + 2,000,000 = 5,000,000 of contribution is needed, and 5,000,000 ÷ 14.00 = 357,143."], ["Operating income with a 5 per cent price rise", "1,800,000: the price becomes 42.00 and the margin 42.00 − 26.00 = 16.00, so 300,000 × 16.00 = 4,800,000 less 3,000,000."], ["What it tells you", "A five per cent price rise adds 600,000 of operating income at unchanged volume, which is half as much again as the company earns, and the same gain would need about 43,000 extra units — a 14 per cent volume rise — to achieve any other way."]]], "figures": {"F702-01": 0, "F702-02": 2, "F702-03": 4, "F702-04": 6, "F702-05": 8, "F702-06": 10, "F702-07": 12}, "tsec": {"0": "", "1": "", "2": "2.1", "3": "2.1", "4": "2.2", "5": "2.2", "6": "2.3", "7": "2.3", "8": "2.4", "9": "2.4", "10": "2.5", "11": "2.5", "12": "2.5"}}